# Hamato Guardian Stance's only target is gone when it resolves (Bot2 Bolts Bot1's Action News Crew in response), so the spell
# does not resolve (CR 608.2b): nothing is pumped and the "Scry 1" never happens (`! Bot1.Arrange`, and the library, Black
# Lotus above Mox Sapphire, is untouched).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl x3
Action News Crew
Hamato Guardian Stance
Plains x2
Lightning Bolt
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Action News Crew.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#3.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hamato Guardian Stance.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Action News Crew)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Action News Crew)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Arrange

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Hamato Guardian Stance; Action News Crew
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Library = Black Lotus; Mox Sapphire
